{"title":"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A piece of cheese is located at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836333fe92d63dccc6ba1e2ae80df30ea9ed5dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(12,10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> in a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Coordinate_plane\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Coordinate plane\">coordinate plane</a>. A mouse is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/043b3c9c08690a58e011eb238316a58295360bed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> and is running up the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">line</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4fd99f6fd96f5b045d52ee984bd5f0ac3d16f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-5x+18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />. At the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> the mouse starts getting farther from the cheese rather than closer to it. What is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91a8bc1f9043d0e64a70f4539ca34d59d0036be7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 6\\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 10\\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 14\\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 18\\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> is the foot of the perpendicular from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836333fe92d63dccc6ba1e2ae80df30ea9ed5dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(12,10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> to the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4fd99f6fd96f5b045d52ee984bd5f0ac3d16f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-5x+18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />. The perpendicular has slope <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d129a7b3c0bf9fbd0693afdd426a66d2a0a8c3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, so its equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/a/d0a4667eb85be7a9f26d8ef1890754d8ba7c8342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=10+\\frac{1}{5}(x-12)=\\frac{1}{5}x+\\frac{38}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"246\" height=\"38\" />. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinate at the foot of the perpendicular satisfies the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/1/6e1f89c2bc15e221128bd0aebfe5f5f8a3e377bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}x+\\frac{38}{5}=-5x+18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/50963023bad76e59c068ca71662bcd770c73f556.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-5\\cdot2+18=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"17\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/b/b0ba1ddf17cfc6a8ea59f131c2fe1d528fa861fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b) = (2,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/f/2cfe58a7c907993a4359843ddb96e09edc505f7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"95\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the mouse is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/9/f096d8fa66ca5624ef03016d697c772f99318a99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y) = (x, 18 - 5x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />, then the square of the distance from the mouse to the cheese is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/c/7cc13300a54a7a5483ed952f346eab6b9f66162a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 12)^2 + (8 - 5x)^2 = 26(x^2 - 4x + 8) = 26((x - 2)^2 + 4).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"472\" height=\"21\" />\nThe value of this expression is smallest when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, so the mouse is closest to the cheese at the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bac0bd179c9337dea0f245160802ea78e9584a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/1/1413115dc451a033eac3f6c16e0d3a2a16d1857f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=2+8 = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are trying to find the point where distance between the mouse and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b68a82bba7425a629a6a8fb2101ae024cc8b8347.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(12, 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> is minimized. This point is where the line that passes through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b68a82bba7425a629a6a8fb2101ae024cc8b8347.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(12, 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> and is perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4fd99f6fd96f5b045d52ee984bd5f0ac3d16f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-5x+18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" /> intersects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4fd99f6fd96f5b045d52ee984bd5f0ac3d16f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-5x+18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />. By basic knowledge of perpendicular lines, this line is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79fb319e6bf764c7a3507aa7943f13e9254eb74a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{x}{5}+\\frac{38}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"91\" height=\"37\" />. This line intersects <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4fd99f6fd96f5b045d52ee984bd5f0ac3d16f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-5x+18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/0/990cfee9f8fcfcd28b839edff474bb09d81e4891.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03fd11fc14f3659bf9aab99365c46bf813adbe80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=\\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"23\" />. - MegaLucario1001\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the mouse is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/9/f096d8fa66ca5624ef03016d697c772f99318a99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y) = (x, 18 - 5x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />, then the square of the distance from the mouse to the cheese is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/b/92bea7c497a5d8132a43fb499227c27e407cbd5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x - 12)^2 + (8 - 5x)^2 = 26(x^2 - 4x + 8) = 26((x - 2)^2 + 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"467\" height=\"21\" />.\nThe value of this expression is smallest when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, so the mouse is closest to the cheese at the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/bac0bd179c9337dea0f245160802ea78e9584a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/1/1413115dc451a033eac3f6c16e0d3a2a16d1857f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=2+8 = \\boxed{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"23\" />.\n-Paixiao\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A\">2007 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017012843\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 280/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6579/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.884      1 -total\n 60.23%    8.964      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 37.87%    5.636      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5219:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017012843 and revision id 206161. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}